; Trust anchors of the DNS root, as IANA publishes them in
; https://data.iana.org/root-anchors/root-anchors.xml
;
; Both root keys are listed. KSK-2024 replaced KSK-2017 as the key that signs
; the root in October 2026: a resolver that only knew the older one answered
; SERVFAIL to every name from that day on. unbound keeps this file up to date
; by itself afterwards (auto-trust-anchor-file, RFC 5011).
. IN DS 20326 8 2 E06D44B80B8F1D39A95C0B0D7C65D08458E880409BBC683457104237C7F8EC8D
. IN DS 38696 8 2 683D2D0ACB8C9B712A1948B27F741219298D0A450D612C483AF444A4C0FB2B16
